` alone merges the next planned Pomodoro into the current one, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and `=*build` merges the next planned Pomodoro below BUILD into [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]BUILD. Every surface (live preview card, CLI output, completion [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]menus, docs) shows which Pomodoros bob picked and the explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]spelling it resolved to, so the shortcut never surprises.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]merge_next_planned_default.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/merge_next_planned_default.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-fw[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-fw/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli resolves, reports, and teaches the implied merge[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob: make dest-less `=*` / `=*<src>` complete merges that absorb the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]next planned Pomodoro below the source; add `source_role`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`absorbed[].role`, and `explicit` to the merge report, a `same as` CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line, completion labels and `initial_selection`, a `merge_next_missing` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]error, tests, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac Capture merge card shows what bob picked[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode the new merge fields, mark the implied source (`Current`) [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and absorbed rows (`Next`), add a tinted `Same as =*plan#fix` caption [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a `#name` teaching hint, and document the merge card and protocol [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-fw","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-fw.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-fw.1"},"source_run_id":"run-3cf468fadb5cdc4ebbaff76ea1f0c8ce","started_at":"2026-11-02T14:58:17.863377+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1793634796,"sha":"508872164ecc7f2c71fd4ec03c8fdd69acd9ccce","subject":"feat(capture): merge the next planned Pomodoro by default"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"05cbab74d44466c9a960d37d5f688e500980b4ac21c72f6e9dbf46362253771a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-fw.1--4/chat.md","size_bytes":37757},"commits":{"digest":"e603b8ece9c5018ded318cb83a1154c452dc847e35a932aeb9b00cd710948ffb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-fw.1--4/commits.json","size_bytes":235},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"96197f9db33f25da32f62bc18d9ebb78c411ffb0e30247e6ddea8243fa722003","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-fw.1--4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":64},"meta":{"digest":"140f8ed2143a43dec40b5b6444c2bdedae0edc07b7e878601a4248db23ee1ea7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-fw.1--4/meta.json","size_bytes":661},"prompt":{"digest":"87c50e80a8b26fac11bce009d1d747928c7bf8064d4923113eee307dc59e7df9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-fw.1--4/prompt.md","size_bytes":2477},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"580d92f738c4a6d0b097b8f15be657d1acd2e3934cc275d69da7b73f4e43e4ef","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-fw.1--4/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":2775},"state":{"digest":"9109